  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "Lâi khì se̍h Bān-tan-hiong（有聲♪）"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<iframe allowfullscreen=\"\" frameborder=\"0\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Xbveosx346k?list=PLXGFtP8Nq2rPRttUxu-6cAsoUJjZAB6BQ\" width=\"640\"></iframe></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%; margin-bottom: 6.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-para-margin-bottom: .5gd; text-indent: 24.0pt;\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center; text-indent: 0px;\">\n台文通訊BONG報九月號（No.270）</div>\n<div style=\"text-indent: 0px;\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n-----------------------------------------------</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%; margin-bottom: 6.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-para-margin-bottom: .5gd; text-indent: 24.0pt;\">\n<span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"text-indent: 0px;\">▍</span>Lâi khì se̍h Bān-tan-hiong</span></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%; margin-bottom: 6.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-para-margin-bottom: .5gd; text-indent: 24.0pt;\">\n<span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"text-indent: 0px;\">作者：</span>N̂g Huī-lîng</span><br />\n<span lang=\"EN-US\"><br /></span></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%; margin-bottom: 6.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-para-margin-bottom: .5gd; text-indent: 24.0pt;\">\n<span lang=\"EN-US\">Ta̍k-ê nā kuè-lâi Bān-tan, lóng ē siūnn-tio̍h âng-tāu-á</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">；</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">bô m̄-tio̍h, Bān-tan ê âng-tāu-á ta̍k-lia̍p pá-muá, bô-lūn sī tsú âng-tāu-thng ia̍h-sī tsò âng-tāu-piánn, lóng tsiok ū tsu-bī koh hó-tsia̍h.</span></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%; margin-bottom: 6.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-para-margin-bottom: .5gd; text-indent: 24.0pt;\">\n<span lang=\"EN-US\">M̄-koh, Bān-tan tû-liáu hó-tsia̍h ê âng-tāu í-guā koh ū tshàu-tāu-hū, iûnn-bah-lôo koh ū ōo-ping,tse lóng sī</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">「</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">Tíng-káng ū miâ-siann, ē-káng siōng tshut-miâ</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">」</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%; margin-bottom: 6.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-para-margin-bottom: .5gd; text-indent: 24.0pt;\">\n<span lang=\"EN-US\">Līng-guā, koh tshui-tsiàn ta̍k-ê kíng-tiám, tō sī nî-hué-suann</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">（泥火山）</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"> koh bo̍k-tiûnn, lóng sī tsin sik-ha̍p tshin-tsú lí-iû ê hó sóo-tsāi</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">！</span></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%; margin-bottom: 6.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-para-margin-bottom: .5gd; text-indent: 24.0pt;\">\n<span lang=\"EN-US\">Huan-gîng ta̍k-ê nā ū-îng, tsò-hué lâi Bān-tan se̍h-se̍h--leh.</span></div>\n<br />\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%; margin-bottom: 6.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-para-margin-bottom: .5gd; text-indent: 24.0pt;\">\n<span lang=\"EN-US\">(Tsit</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">篇是高師大台語師資班學員</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">ê</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;新細明體&quot; , &quot;serif&quot;; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">宿題，感謝鄭雅怡老師提供</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></div>\n"
  },
